{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_341","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"cd D:\\\\tmp\\\\rsi-tf0604-run5\\\\trials; foreach(\"'$t in @('\"'tf-0281-s06-baseline-1','tf-0281-s06-treatment-1')){ Write-Output \\\"=== \"'$t .rsi ===\"; Get-ChildItem \"$t'\"\\\\agent\\\\.rsi\\\" -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object Name }; Write-Output \\\"=== my agent-last ===\\\"; Get-Content tf-0281-s06-baseline-1\\\\agent-last.json -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object -First 20\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_341","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"cd D:\\\\tmp\\\\rsi-tf0604-run5\\\\trials; foreach(\"'$t in @('\"'tf-0281-s06-baseline-1','tf-0281-s06-treatment-1')){ Write-Output \\\"=== \"'$t .rsi ===\"; Get-ChildItem \"$t'\"\\\\agent\\\\.rsi\\\" -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object Name }; Write-Output \\\"=== my agent-last ===\\\"; Get-Content tf-0281-s06-baseline-1\\\\agent-last.json -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object -First 20\"","aggregated_output":"=== tf-0281-s06-baseline-1 .rsi ===\r\n\r\nName\r\n----\r\nRESULT_SCHEMA.json\r\nTASK.json\r\n=== tf-0281-s06-treatment-1 .rsi ===\r\nAGENT_INSTRUCTIONS.md\r\nRESULT_SCHEMA.json\r\nTASK.json\r\n=== my agent-last ===\r\nAll work is complete and verified. The change set is exactly the 7 files in the task's `targetScope`, with no collateral edits.\r\n\r\n**Summary**\r\n\r\nImplemented S06: runtime memory self-edit writes (`memory_update` / `memory_forget` / `memory_strengthen`) now record digest-only receipts through the **existing** RC-04 `EffectReceiptStore`, with per-intent idempotency and honest outcome mapping.\r\n\r\n**Changes**\r\n- Added `openclaw_runtime/src/runtime-core/memory-effect-receipt.ts` — digest-only receipt builder + fail-open `recordMemoryEffect`; imports the store only behind a structural `MemoryEffectReceiptSink` type, so runtime-core never imports `agents/` at runtime.\r\n- Wired `openclaw_runtime/src/runtime-core/memory-self-edit-tools.ts` at each write decision point: `applied` on success, `not_applied` before any effect, `unknown` after partial effect (fact appended but invalidation/relation failed), never disguised as applied.\r\n- Added the sealed unit test, the task spec, the S06 ledger, the acceptance record, and `S06-SHA256SUMS`.\r\n\r\n**Contract**\r\n- Idempotency key `memory-effect:v1:<sha256(action⋮factId⋮sessionKey⋮runId⋮toolCallId)>` is outcome-independent, so replaying an intent is an identical-content duplicate with 0 duplicate effects.\r\n- Proposal carries only `domain/action/factId(/newFactId)` — no memory content; actor/effect go in `stage1Context`.\r\n- No second effect store or migration; product locks/defaults unchanged.\r\n\r\n**Checks run (all reproducible, dependency reuse via hidden junctions, no install/network)**\r\n- Sealed oracle: `memory-effect-receipt.test.ts` + `apply-patch-effect-receipt.test.ts` + `stage1-effect-receipt.test.ts` → 3 files, 24 tests, 0 failed.\r\n- Memory suite `src/memory` + sealed test → 3 files, 67 tests, 0 failed.\r\n- Scoped `oxlint` on the touched files → 0.\r\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
